OL,3,AJonathan Ross 'horrified' by Walliams
OL,4,Aallegations and Brand conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV presenter Jonathan Ross has said he
OL,7,Fis "horrified" by allegations of sexual
OL,8,Fmisconduct against David Walliams and
OL,9,Fthe rape conviction of Russell Brand.
OL,11,FIn a statement, Ross said he was once
OL,12,F"on friendly terms with both men", but
OL,13,Fthat at the time he was "genuinely
OL,14,Funaware of their conduct".
OL,16,FITV News and the Guardian on Tuesday
OL,17,Fpublished reports alleging that
OL,18,FWalliams has been accused of sexual
OL,19,Fmisconduct by several women. Walliams
OL,20,Fdenies all the allegations against him.
OL,21,FBrand was sentenced to 10 years in jail
OL,22,Ffor rape on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
