OL,3,AScottish man confirmed as victim of
OL,4,AKrakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish man has been confirmed as
OL,7,Fone of the victims of a mass shooting
OL,8,Fin Poland that left six people dead.
OL,10,FThe man, who is understood to be James
OL,11,FThomas Campbell from Prestwick in South
OL,12,FAyrshire, died when a lone gunman
OL,13,Fopened fire in central Krakow on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FCampbell, 32, worked as a DJ in
OL,17,FAyrshire. Police Scotland confirmed it
OL,18,Fwas providing specialist support to the
OL,19,Fvictim's family, but formal
OL,20,Fidentification is yet to be carried
OL,21,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
