OL,3,AFour grizzly bears killed in Canada
OL,4,Aafter fatal attack on mother and
OL,5,Adaughter
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll four were destroyed "in accordance
OL,8,Fwith provincial human-wildlife conflict
OL,9,Fresponse guidelines" to protect the
OL,10,Fpublic, BCCOS Inspector Jeff Tyre said
OL,11,Fin an update on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
